headings.text:
[86] Literally, &quot;Becoming partakers of many great and glorious deeds,
let us return to the aim of peace delivered to us from the beginning.&quot;
Comp. Heb. xii. 1.

[185] Isa. lx. 17, Sept.; but the text is here altered by Clement. The
LXX. have &quot;I will give thy rulers in peace, and thy overseers in
righteousness.&quot;
